  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492540/diamond-spheres-harmony-and-discord?affiliate_id=3028400\">Diamond Spheres: Harmony &amp; Discord</a></sup></p>\n<p>If you possess the (dredge) package, you can spend an additional 5 minutes when dredging to also camouflage the dredged area, changing the DC to perceive the dredged effect to 10 + your modifier in the associated skill. A creature that fails this check suffers a -2 penalty to any saving throws associated with the dredged area.</p>\n<p>If a (ground) option already allows you to camouflage the dredged area (such as the Pit talent), the penalty to saving throws associated with the area increases by 2.</p>\n<p>If you possess the (harvest) package, you can harvest all components you have the appropriate (harvest) talent for in 1 minute, instead of just one component. Additionally, you can spend 1 use of skill leverage when you gain the results of a refine attempt, allowing you to add the listed potency effect of the component regardless of the skill check.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/survivalism#toc18\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
